<title>JAPAN: Subaru Enterprise - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Subaru Enterprise - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to July 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
